# Public repository root .gitignore. The export script copies this file to
# `.gitignore` at the root of the exported tree; the repository's own root
# .gitignore is internal and is not exported.
# 公开仓库根 .gitignore。导出脚本会把本文件复制为导出树根部的 `.gitignore`；
# 仓库自身的根 .gitignore 是内部文件，不导出。

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
.build-deps/
build/
target/
.swiftpm/
native/macos/.build/
tmp/

